        <item>
            <title>0.6.25</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 14:43:12 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.25</link>
            <sparkle:version>58</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.25</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.25

- Fixes short or cancelled dictations getting stuck in a listening state.
- Keeps model download, loading, and recovery messages accurate throughout dictation.
- Prevents overlapping file transcriptions and stale results from replacing the current recording.
- Keeps Meeting Mode private for the full capture when Private Session was active at any point.
- Adds standard macOS menus, keyboard focus improvements, and more reliable menu-bar/window behavior.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.25/Kiki-0.6.25-macOS.zip" length="53786136" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="2I0nbcVfbqEVT+EzFNiIptocKk8McVGi9mN8l/x/vmGaM2WxTgOGBUAc+58tJlXm2UuP2Rzzn+Jy/bq49SYhAA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.6.24</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 17:11:33 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.24</link>
            <sparkle:version>57</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.24</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.24

- Keeps normal-length Voice Studio scripts in one continuous generation instead of stitching together multiple acoustic takes.
- Prevents abrupt changes in loudness, room tone, and delivery during ordinary generated audio.
- Makes continuous generation faster while preserving sectioning for unusually long scripts.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.24/Kiki-0.6.24-macOS.zip" length="53771693" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Ze6tI81wniwzTe8tymN5zx8QG2a5LUu9FY56b5t1Bi9EPE4OffyV6RjjyjHUyAB2uR/UxKHMPTIuscmjrlRRAg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.6.23</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 13:14:09 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.23</link>
            <sparkle:version>56</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.23</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.23

- Expands voice enrollment to three concise sentences covering natural, energetic, and thoughtful delivery.
- Keeps the sample to about 10–15 seconds so generation stays fast and avoids enrollment-script leakage.
- Updates Voice Studio guidance and recording limits for the balanced sample.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.23/Kiki-0.6.23-macOS.zip" length="53764123" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Aiv8ioUEen/CEj4wj6ws87k88GxqHp8EOUDEz+L57AI+WYrU3iIKeGYJoqGE/5a0CpfsOD5Sb8UojGZLtJMgAA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.6.22</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:35:33 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.22</link>
            <sparkle:version>55</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.22</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.22

- Fixes Voice Studio generating words from the enrollment recording instead of the text in Create Audio.
- Replaces long voice enrollment with one short, transcript-matched sample for faster, reliable generation.
- Clearly asks for a new short sample and blocks generation when an older recording could produce incorrect speech.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.22/Kiki-0.6.22-macOS.zip" length="53763507" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="73l4pqgH0q7JLe33nQ/+pagKY0QiuoqZ8O+7bj2hMu4uQejFsnRoB5d78v1W09hejuzO1Q8//pOplX88OvImCw=="/>
